      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4069,
        "name": "Transoceanic Pearl",
        "desc": "<p>A small crystal obtained from a defeated Fontemer Aberrant.</p><p>Fontemer Aberrants arise from Fontaine's sea. They are believed to be a unique life form born from the mysterious energy in the water.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/02/151578876/0e951d06ab200a1578724fed95d842ca_1606585050860578318.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4068,
        "name": "Transoceanic Chunk",
        "desc": "<p>A crystal obtained from a defeated Fontemer Aberrant.</p><p>It gives off a somewhat mysterious energy. Although many legends speak of great life forms residing in remote seas beyond human reach, ordinary oceans can hardly compare to the vibrant seas of Fontaine.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/02/151578876/35ab3651275afb059f079c578c4cbfbd_8761620195624707684.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4067,
        "name": "Xenochromatic Crystal",
        "desc": "<p>A large crystal obtained from a defeated Fontemer Aberrant.</p><p>It contains a mysterious energy.</p><p>All rivers and seas originate in Fontaine, but the water loses all its unique properties once it flows outside Fontaine's borders.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/02/151578876/4bc36681d1975fcd36ed2965771c995d_8999049758835622415.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4634,
        "name": "Mysterious Xenochromatic Crystal",
        "desc": "<p>A large crystal obtained by defeating the extremely powerful Fontemer Aberrants in the Morte Region.</p><p>The power it contains is more mysterious than common Xenochromatic Crystals.</p><p>Maybe someone will be willing to pay the right price for it.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/02/24/35428890/0adc5eb287f61786280cb9d7f8b7ce58_4462586361947599802.png"
